  "notes": "moe.gov.jo refused connections during checking, so the ministry pages are cited through Internet Archive copies. Basic education is grades 1-10; secondary is grades 11-12. Under the new Tawjihi system the general secondary exam is split across grades 11 and 12. Students choose academic or vocational (BTEC) paths after grade 9. 'الأول/الثاني الثانوي' is the older name for grades 11/12."
